# --- Large / binary media (add on each machine; keep the repo text-only) ---

# Slide photos, project images, avatars, etc. served as `/...` (see `public/`)
public/**/*.avif
public/**/*.gif
public/**/*.jpeg
public/**/*.jpg
public/**/*.png
public/**/*.webp
public/**/.DS_Store

# App-level raster assets (backgrounds, 3D props, one-off photos). Keep small PNGs
# used by layouts under `assets/cert-logos/`.
assets/**/*.avif
assets/**/*.gif
assets/**/*.jpeg
assets/**/*.jpg
assets/**/*.png
assets/**/*.webp
!assets/cert-logos/*.png
assets/individual_photos/

# Parallel “content pack” (mirrors/exports of media); markdown under `content/` is fine
code-coffee-contents-and-elements/graphics/
